  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Democratic Institute Burkina Faso: Paving the way to democratic success - Support to National Democratic Institute Burkina Faso</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">National Democratic Institute Burkina Faso: Paving the way to democratic success</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">National Democratic Institute (NDI) f&#xf6;resl&#xe5;r ett program med det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let att h&#xe5;llbart st&#xe4;rka den demokratiska motst&#xe5;ndskraften under och efter &#xf6;verg&#xe5;ngsperioden. Programmet kommer att st&#xf6;dja det burkinska civilsamh&#xe4;llet i att aktivt delta i demokratiska processer, att fr&#xe4;mja ansvarsskyldighet, att informera medborgarna om politiska och demokratiska processer f&#xf6;r att fr&#xe4;mja deras engagemang och deltagande. Programmet kommer vidare att ge tekniskt st&#xf6;d till politiska partier f&#xf6;r att anta reformer i syfte att bli mer inkluderande och lyh&#xf6;rda inf&#xf6;r medborgarnas prioriteringar.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The National Democratic Institute proposes a program with the overarching goal of durably building democratic resilience during and beyond the transition. The program would support Burkinabe civil society in participating actively in democratic processes and promoting accountability, seek to inform citizens about political and democratic processes to foster engagement and participation and provide technical assistance to political parties in adopting reforms to become more inclusive and responsive to citizens&#x2019; priorities.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme goal:
Building democratic resilience during and beyond the transition in Burkina Faso.

Objective 1: Burkinabe civil society promotes democratic processes and accountability.

Objective 2: Informed and organized citizens participate in political and democratic processes.

Objective 3: Political parties adopt reforms for better inclusivity and responsiveness to citizens priorities.</narrative>
  </description>
